                    Scene @DBG_START: The scribe takes his station.

[Enter Prospero and Puck]

Prospero:
 We shall proceed to scene @DBG_POP.


                    Scene @DBG_POP: The herald yields one word and it is counted aloud.

Prospero:
 Recall the herald's present word.

Prospero:
 Are you as honest as a curse?

Puck:
 If so, let us proceed to scene @DBG_DONE.

Prospero:
 Open your heart!

Prospero:
 You are as honest as the sum of a little furry black cat and a black cat.

Prospero:
 Speak your mind!

Prospero:
 We shall return to scene @DBG_POP.


                    Scene @DBG_DONE: The counting is done.

[Exeunt]
